        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 1031,
      "author": {
        "id": 7725
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-05-19T19:13:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it has to be the default. According to section 8.1.4 the requirement is within 90 days. A deployer could relax that if they wanted to, but I think out of the box we should be PCI compliant where possible.",
